{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわん^･ω･^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/26/dvc00462.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日(25日)は、3時のつボッ！と中日新聞の取材やラジオに出させて頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪に続いて二回目の生放送で緊張したんですが、みんなで楽しくできたのでよかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜は名古屋の名物、手羽先や味噌カツを食べたよ(*´ω｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて食べて美味しすぎた結果、約20個程平らげました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーやスタッフさんに食べすぎー！太っちゃうじゃん！って言われた。。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ、1個が小さかったから大丈夫さ(^_-)-☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のホテルは \"かなりん\" と一緒だったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりん推しの方、羨ましいでしょ(*´ω｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一つ、かなりんの寝顔はめっちゃ可愛いです。。。//\nうたた寝してたかなりんを観察してたとか内緒ね！(はぁと)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今日のホテルの相手はそう…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなせいらりんであります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/26/dvc00458.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうテンションMAX。笑\n今日は一緒に一夜を共にします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらりんとまいやんの仲を知りたい方がいましたら、せいらりんblogまで…"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はしゃぎすぎてなかなか寝れない夜になりそう(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は語ってるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は名古屋イベントです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんに楽しんで貰えるように、メンバーみんな頑張るので、是非来てください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しい一日にしましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんパワーで頑張りますo(^-^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな待っててねん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart